SUMMARY:V for Volleyball at Wilson Park
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nI'm Mike an
 d my son is Michael too. You must serve to score\, games to 25.\nOutdoor h
 ard court. No kicking\, no using your head.\nThere's no fee to play\, mayb
 e bring a ball. We'll have 2 Mikasa balls & 1 Wilson ball.\nCourt is publi
 c so we can mix in\, challenge them as a group\, or we will move to the gr
 ass since we have our own Volleyball NET/poles!\nhttps://fb.me/e/81LY1qbmo
 \nIf you have fun and would like to play with us at other locations\, join
  us!\nJoin our group at [V for Volleyball New Jersey | Facebook](https://w
 ww.facebook.com/groups/1587314685975434)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316871284/
